      <td><strong>Amazon Kindle (Paperwhite / Scribe)</strong></td>
      <td>Requires conversion to AZW3/KFX</td>
      <td>USB (Send to Kindle via email, Calibre with converter)</td>
      <td>Kindles don't read EPUB directly. Use Calibre to convert EPUB to AZW3 or KFX, or send via Amazon's Send to Kindle service (which accepts EPUB since 2025).</td>
    </tr>
