      <td>Android e-readers can run Instapaper's own app, KOReader, or any EPUB reader from Google Play. The most flexible option for Instapaper power users.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2 id="instapaper-vs-pocket">Instapaper vs Pocket vs Readwise: Which Export Creates the Best EPUB?</h2>

<p>Instapaper isn't the only read-later service with EPUB export. Here's how it stacks up against competitors:</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Service</th>
      <th>EPUB Export Quality</th>
